00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:09.000
in the Hereafter that God wishes to give each one of them a few million dollars and a mansion and let them have fun here for 60 or 70 years.

00:35:11.000 --> 00:35:13.000
Because after that they're heading for Hell.

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:16.000
Dr. Khalifa: But then, the test would become more difficult for the believers.

00:35:19.000 --> 00:35:21.000
A woman: Rashad, I have a questions.

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:29.000
We read in the Quran that the rich believer is better than poor, but throughout the Quran also we read that

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:41.000
