00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:45.000
Dr. Khalifa: Ok. Let us say we were all poor, we're all believers.

00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:51.000
We are all believers and we barely, barely make, we're very poor, how will you print this Quran for example?

00:35:53.000 --> 00:36:02.000
Dr. Khalifa: It's a good thing that we have this here and we sent it to (unintelligible) coming all the way from Nigeria because he received the message and the Quran and

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:04.000
Dr. Khalifa: books. A woman: We cannot (unintelligible).

00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:10.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes. It doesn't make any difference. Your dollars are already assigned to you but go ahead and ask.

00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:21.000
