00:36:21.000 --> 00:36:23.000
Your dollars from birth to death are already assigned.

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:26.000
Dr. Khalifa: Ask Jan about that.

00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:32.000
A man: (unintelligible) Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, (unintelligible) A man: (unintelligible)

00:36:39.000 --> 00:36:48.000
Dr. Khalifa: But you know, as it is with the believers, you're guaranteed all your needs, your health, your wealth, guaranteed a perfect life for a believer.

00:36:49.000 --> 00:37:00.000
And you may have zero in the bank but you will not worry and you have peace of mind and the IRS cannot touch you.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:03.000
Dr. Khalifa: You have your money deposited up there.

00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:15.000
