Dr. Khalifa: Yes. Edip: Hoarding more money as if (unintelligible) I don't know that probably (unintelligible).

00:37:41.000 --> 00:37:42.000
Dr. Khalifa: That's what God said.

00:37:43.000 --> 00:37:46.000
Remember that the common denominator is believer.

00:37:47.000 --> 00:37:49.000
Dr. Khalifa: The Rich Believer is Better than the Poor Believer

