00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:09.000
Dr. Khalifa: I'm glad you're watching, Apamea.

00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:13.000
Edip: Sure, it's a good thing.

00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:16.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes. Edip: But it is not just so... Dr. Khalifa: Alright, we agree.

00:39:16.000 --> 00:39:18.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, God said

00:39:18.000 --> 00:39:21.000
Edip: Yeah, for believers to be rich is surely is better than to be poor but...

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:22.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes. Thank you very much.

