in the sense that for the rich believer to appreciate the gifts that are given to him,

00:39:52.000 --> 00:39:58.000
A man: that it's from God and then use these gifts in the cause of God Dr. Khalifa: Exactly.

00:39:58.000 --> 00:40:05.000
