00:42:54.000 --> 00:43:05.000
for example, read the Quran and whatever that they think is being righteous. To me, I think their work

00:43:05.000 --> 00:43:13.000
I say they both have even the same knowledge. (unintelligible) I say "Ok, I need 8 hours of sleep."

00:43:13.000 --> 00:43:21.000
And I do whatever I do and I only want for example 8 hours. The other one says

00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:30.000
A man: "ok, I sleep only 6 hours. I work harder." And that's the reason that he became richer and he has more money. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:35.000
A man: Then, to me that person works harder.

00:43:35.000 --> 00:43:41.000
And we can say "yes, their belief are the same." They are both righteous. Their belief are the same.

00:43:41.000 --> 00:43:48.000
A man: Yes, that one is better because he works harder and achieves whatever he got, what he has.

00:43:50.000 --> 00:43:54.000
