00:43:54.000 --> 00:43:57.000
who don't work at all and they are very rich anyway.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:04.000
Yes, but if they are, they are both believers,

00:44:04.000 --> 00:44:11.000
then the rich, I mean, according to the Quran, what God is telling us is that the rich has a better chance to be charitable, to help the others, to

00:44:11.000 --> 00:44:17.000
Dr. Khalifa: to publish the Quran or whatever. The things that need money. The thing that is what...

00:44:18.000 --> 00:44:26.000
