00:44:34.000 --> 00:44:41.000
coming home around the sunset Prayers and, you know, four or five kids in the house with the wife

00:44:41.000 --> 00:44:48.000
and he went out to work, coming home, he couldn't get anything and when he comes into the household

00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:53.000
the kids crying all over the places and the wife making faces,

00:44:53.000 --> 00:44:57.000
A man: you can (unintelligible) Prayer at that time. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:44:57.000 --> 00:45:00.000
Dr. Khalifa: Distractions. A man: A rich man, you don't have any of these problems.

00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:08.000
A man: And the moment you come home, you know the food is there, the kids are playing with their motorbikes and all these things. He goes Praying and then (unintelligible).

00:45:08.000 --> 00:45:13.000
Dr. Khalifa: You concentrate on the Prayer. A man: You can concentrate on the Prayer. Dr. Khalifa: Yes. Exactly. That also.

00:45:13.000 --> 00:45:17.000
Dr. Khalifa: Anyway, we cannot fool around with the principle that the rich believer is better than the poor believer.

00:45:19.000 --> 00:45:25.000
And, ok, Edip wants to make a lot of money so he can publish a translation in Turkey and

00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:30.000
Dr. Khalifa: build a mosque in his hometown and buy a few dresses for Apamea. Apamea: IN SHAA ALLAH.

