Dr. Khalifa: Also, we don't know how much money is written for us. A man: Yeah.

00:46:34.000 --> 00:46:38.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, we have to work as hard as possible. It's God's perfect system.

00:46:39.000 --> 00:46:42.000
A man: Only God knows how much He has assigned to you. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:46:42.000 --> 00:46:43.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, we don't know.

00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:49.000
