00:46:50.000 --> 00:46:51.000
Dr. Khalifa: But you have to knock.

00:46:53.000 --> 00:46:55.000
Edip: So, why you cannot be PhDs.

00:46:57.000 --> 00:47:03.000
Edip: It's Farhad. Farhad is going (unintelligible)

00:47:05.000 --> 00:47:06.000
Dr. Khalifa: You never know.

00:47:07.000 --> 00:47:09.000
A man: (unintelligible)

00:47:11.000 --> 00:47:13.000
Dr. Khalifa: Somebody push the door. It is getting cold.

00:47:15.000 --> 00:47:34.000
A woman: Rashad, is poor, isn't poor and rich relative to, to the place that the poor and rich people live? It is said just now about Solomon and Job. Job was rich within where Job was. What richness meant in Job...

00:47:34.000 --> 00:47:35.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, Job was rich. Period.

00:47:35.000 --> 00:47:37.000
A man: (unintelligible) A woman: very wealthy? Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:38.000
A woman: For Job, so, ...

00:47:39.000 --> 00:47:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: No. Period. He was very wealthy. Period.

00:47:42.000 --> 00:47:45.000
Dr. Khalifa: He became poor for a while. A woman: Right and then he...

00:47:45.000 --> 00:47:47.000
Dr. Khalifa: Then, he was, became twice as rich. A woman: Twice as rich. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:47:47.000 --> 00:47:56.000
A woman: Right. So, even, so, even though he wasn't as wealthy as Solomon, he was a wealthy person in that time. Dr. Khalifa: Right.

00:47:56.000 --> 00:48:05.000
A woman: So, poor and rich have to be relative to where poor and rich really is because in some places

00:48:05.000 --> 00:48:13.000
rich may mean a million dollars and that's really wealthy. It can do just as much as 10 million dollars

00:48:13.000 --> 00:48:19.000
