00:48:19.000 --> 00:48:27.000
A woman: (unintelligible). I think the statement of a poor... a rich believer is better than a poor is a very good

00:48:27.000 --> 00:48:33.000
character building statement for a believer. It gives you the need to strive, it makes you want to

00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:36.000
A woman: to build yourself to do something. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:48:36.000 --> 00:48:40.000
A woman: And it makes you want to give. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: Definitely.

00:49:19.000 --> 00:49:24.000
