00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:26.000
A man: Rashad Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:49:26.000 --> 00:49:33.000
A man: When God says "a rich believer is better than a poor." It means in this world, right? Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:49:33.000 --> 00:49:36.000
A man: Not Hereafter. Dr. Khalifa: Right.

00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:45.000
Dr. Khalifa: Also, in the Hereafter. There will be ranks in the Hereafter. I think

00:49:45.000 --> 00:49:52.000
this is where Heaven and Hell... we can think of it, if we apply the terms of this world,

00:49:52.000 --> 00:49:58.000
a ditch digger out, when it is 110 degrees here in Tucson and somebody is digging ditches out there,

00:49:58.000 --> 00:50:04.000
he's hoping that he will save enough money someday to import cheese from Greece and sell it here. You know, stop...

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:12.000
In other words, there is a hope that this will end, the ditch digging. But if, in the Hereafter a ditch digger is a ditch digger forever,

00:50:12.000 --> 00:50:16.000
there's no hope. This is why it is Hell.

