01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:10.000
[24:46] We have sent down to you clarifying revelations, then GOD guides whoever wills in a straight path.

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:14.000
God Sends Instructions Through His Messenger

01:00:14.000 --> 01:00:21.000
[24:47] They say, "We believe in GOD and in the messenger, and we obey," but then some of them turn away. They are not believers.

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:26.000
[24:48] When they are invited to GOD and His messenger to judge among them, some of them get upset.

01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:33.000
Parivash knows that. Quite a few of them.

01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:38.000
[24:49] However, if the judgment is in their favor, they readily accept it!

01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:48.000
[24:50] Is there a disease in their hearts? Are they doubtful? Are they afraid that GOD and His messenger may treat them unfairly? In fact, it is they who are unfair.

01:00:50.000 --> 01:00:53.000
Believers Unhesitatingly Obey God and His Messenger

01:00:53.000 --> 01:01:04.000
[24:51] The only utterance of the believers, whenever invited to GOD and His messenger to judge in their affairs, is to say, "We hear and we obey." These are the winners.

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:11.000
[24:52] Those who obey GOD and His messenger, and reverence GOD and observe Him, these are the triumphant ones.

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:24.000
[24:53] They swear by GOD, solemnly, that if you commanded them to mobilize, they would mobilize. Say, "Do not swear. Obedience is an obligation. GOD is fully Cognizant of everything you do."

01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:32.000
My own experiences with this is, for example, the issue of 40 years when it surfaced,

01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:37.000
there was so much opposition to it, mainly because we are mean creatures, you know.

01:01:37.000 --> 01:01:43.000
"Why does God put them in Heaven? Put them all in Hell." This is what they were telling me.

01:01:44.000 --> 01:01:52.000
And they argued and we had to use a lot of discussion back and forth, we wasted a lot of time and effort.

01:01:53.000 --> 01:02:03.000
So, had they say "we hear and we obey" and then, take off from that point, we would have saved a lot of time and effort.

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:05.000
It would have saved themselves a lot of time.

01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:08.000
So, this is why God said,

01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:14.000
[24:51] The only utterance of the believers, whenever invited to GOD and His messenger to judge in their affairs, is to say, "We hear and we obey." These are the winners.

01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:16.000
Because they saved their time and effort.

01:02:22.000 --> 01:02:27.000
There were quite a few people, you know, this issue dragged with them for almost a year.

01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:33.000
And the funny thing is some of them I thought they accepted it.

01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:37.000
Dr. Khalifa: Then, a year later, I found that they didn't, they're still having trouble with it.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:45.000
