01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:58.000
Now, let us see, why, why is God setting the age of 40 and why isn't it 45 or 30?

01:02:58.000 --> 01:03:05.000
We can discuss that but after accepting it and knowing it. But what I found was they actually could not accept it.

01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:08.000
It didn't make sense to them.

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:26.000
And I told them "ok, well, give me the break, the line. Where is the line, the cut off line of responsibility? Is it 6 years? When somebody dies at the age 7, does he go to... is he responsible?

01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:36.000
"or at the age of 17? 21? What is it? I mean, give me... ." There is no age in the Quran except 40,

01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:44.000
for the age of responsibility. In other words, they were just objecting without, without having an alternative.

